1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,860
This Game Boy survived a bomb.

2
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:06,243
1991. The Gulf War.

3
00:00:06,603 --> 00:00:09,611
A blast sets an army barracks on fire.

4
00:00:10,021 --> 00:00:12,687
Inside is a nurse's Game Boy.

5
00:00:13,097 --> 00:00:14,494
The case is charred.

6
00:00:14,504 --> 00:00:16,169
The buttons have melted.

7
00:00:16,579 --> 00:00:18,219
It is sent to Nintendo.

8
00:00:18,229 --> 00:00:19,502
They switch it on.

9
00:00:20,412 --> 00:00:22,332
Tetris still plays.

10
00:00:22,942 --> 00:00:26,098
For years, it sat in Nintendo's New York store,

11
00:00:26,108 --> 00:00:27,038
still running.

12
00:00:27,548 --> 00:00:31,729
In 2023, Nintendo finally retired it.
